# SRG SRG-APP-000266-WSR-000142: The web server must display a default hosted application web
# STIG ID: V-206411 (MEDIUM)
# Check: HTTP probe of web server endpoint

META
    esp_id `web-srg-srg-app-000266-wsr-000142-http-no-directory-listing-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `web-server`
    criticality `high`

    title `SRG SRG-APP-000266-WSR-000142: The web server must display a default hosted application web page, not a directo`
    description `The web server must display a default hosted application web page, not a directory listing, when a requested web page cannot be found.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `web-server,srg,disa-stig,http,external`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:SRG-APP-000266-WSR-000142,NIST-800-53:SI-11`
    control_objective `SI-11`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `WebServer:localhost:web-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Review and remediate per DISA Web Server SRG guidance for SRG-APP-000266-WSR-000142.`

    component_id `comp-web-server`

    impl_SI_11 `This control is validated by probing the web server configuration or network endpoint against the DISA Web Server SRG baseline.`

META_END

DEF
    VAR web_url string `https://localhost/`

    OBJECT web_http
        url VAR web_url
        insecure `true`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE http_check
        connected boolean = true
        status_code string != `200`
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN http_probe
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF http_check
            OBJECT_REF web_http
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
